# Copy this file to .env.local and set only what you need.
# The app builds and runs with none of these set.
#
# All JSON processing happens in the browser; your content is never sent anywhere.
#
# Page analytics use Vercel Web Analytics, which needs no environment variable —
# it is enabled per-project from the Vercel dashboard and is inert locally.
# It sets no cookies and records no per-user profile.
#
# There is currently nothing to configure here. The file is kept so that the
# first variable this project needs has an obvious home.
